# Copy to forwarding.secret and replace with a long random value.
# Generate one with:
#     openssl rand -base64 48
#
# This value must match the 'secret' field under proxies.velocity in
# every backend's paper-global.yml. If they disagree, players are
# kicked with "Unable to verify player details".
#
# Treat it like a password: anyone holding it can join any backend as
# any player.
REPLACE_ME_WITH_OPENSSL_RAND_BASE64_48
